### Don't check for the moment

### What I did
before, when we clicked on the button to join a group we were redirected to another page, now a popup appears to ask us for confirmation

### How to test

1. As a trusted user, go to a group of which you are not a member.
2. click on "Request group membership" or 'Join group"

### How it's work

A script looks if I have an element with the attribute "isajaxrequest". If so, then when I click on it I make an ajax request to the address provided in the "data-action" attribute of the element with the class that is provided in the "data-element" attribute 

> action.extra_attributes = [
      {
        name: 'isAjaxRequest'
      },
      {
        name: 'data-action',
        value: action.link.path
      },
      {
        name: 'data-element',
        value: '.group-content-form'
      }
    ]

